        "bookingUrl": "https://www.booking.com/hotel/cl/rao-serrano.fr.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCF3NlYXJjaF90b3JyZXMgZGVsIHBhaW5lSA1YBGhNiAEBmAEzuAEXyAEM2AED6AEB-AEBiAIBqAIBuALgkeTPBsACAdICJDBjZWIxNWJkLTVhNDItNDVmNi05NDJjLWQzMzZjYzNiMTcwOdgCAeACAQ&ucfs=1&arphpl=1&checkin=2027-01-15&checkout=2027-01-16&group_adults=2&req_adults=2&no_rooms=1&group_children=0&req_children=0&hpos=1&hapos=1&sr_order=popularity&nflt=review_score%3D90&srpvid=467b93afad230026&srepoch=1777928418&all_sr_blocks=39912517_169645731_2_21_0&highlighted_blocks=39912517_169645731_2_21_0&matching_block_id=39912517_169645731_2_21_0&sr_pri_blocks=39912517_169645731_2_21_0__97500&from=searchresults",
        "description_fr": "Proposant le bed & breakfast et une pension complète, l’Hotel Río Serrano + Spa se trouve à Torres del Paine. Vous pourrez profiter d’un restaurant sur place et d’un jardin donnant sur le massif du Paine.\nUn petit-déjeuner buffet est servi tous les matins. Les personnes ayant choisi le programme de pension complète bénéficient d’un petit-déjeuner, d’un déjeuner et d’un dîner gratuits.\nLe restaurant vous accueille autour d’une sélection de spécialités régionales accompagnées d’une vaste gamme de vins provenant de la cave de l’établissement. Le bar De agostini sert des boissons et des cocktails.\nVous pourrez participer à des excursions en bateau, à des randonnées et à des activités d’équitation. Des excursions dans la région sont organisées moyennant des frais supplémentaires.",
        "description_en": "Offering Bed & Breakfast and Full-board, Hotel Río Serrano + Spa is in Torres del Paine. There is an on-site restaurant and a garden overlooking the Paine Massif.\nA buffet breakfast is served daily. Guests traveling with the Full-Board program have complimentary breakfast, lunch and dinner.\nRegional specialties can be ordered at the restaurant, while enjoying one of the many wines from the property's cellar. Drinks and cocktails can be enjoyed at De agostini Restobar.\nBoat trips, hiking and horseback riding activities can be practiced. Additionally, guests can explore the areas choosing from several available excursions, for an extra fee.\nHotel Río Serrano is 83 km from Puerto Natales and 325 km from Ibañez del Campo Airport in Punta Arenas.",
        "description_es": "El Hotel Río Serrano + Spa ofrece alojamiento y desayuno y pensión completa en Torres del Paine. El establecimiento alberga un restaurante y un jardín con vistas a la cordillera Paine. \nSe sirve un desayuno buffet a diario. El régimen de pensión completa incluye desayuno, almuerzo y cena gratuitos.\nEl restaurante prepara especialidades regionales y la bodega del hotel ofrece gran variedad de vinos. El bar De agostini sirve bebidas y cócteles.\nHay una oferta variada de actividades, como senderismo, paseos a caballo y paseos en barco. Por un suplemento, se ofrecen varias excursiones para recorrer la zona. \nEl Hotel Río Serrano se sitúa a 83 km de Puerto Natales y a 325 km del aeropuerto Presidente Ibáñez del Campo de Punta Arenas.",
        "description_pt": "Offering Bed & Breakfast and Full-board, Hotel Río Serrano + Spa is in Torres del Paine. There is an on-site restaurant and a garden overlooking the Paine Massif.\nA buffet breakfast is served daily. Guests traveling with the Full-Board program have complimentary breakfast, lunch and dinner.\nRegional specialties can be ordered at the restaurant, while enjoying one of the many wines from the property's cellar. Drinks and cocktails can be enjoyed at De agostini Restobar.\nBoat trips, hiking and horseback riding activities can be practiced. Additionally, guests can explore the areas choosing from several available excursions, for an extra fee.\nHotel Río Serrano is 83 km from Puerto Natales and 325 km from Ibañez del Campo Airport in Punta Arenas.",
        "description_it": "Situato a Torres del Paine, l'Hotel Río Serrano + Spa offre il trattamento di bed and breakfast e pensione completa, un ristorante e un giardino affacciato sulla Cordigliera del Paine.\nOgni mattina vi attende una colazione a buffet. Se scegliete il trattamento di pensione completa, potrete gustare gratuitamente la colazione, il pranzo e la cena.\nIl ristorante propone specialità regionali accompagnate da uno dei numerosi vini della cantina, mentre il De agostini Restobar rappresenta il luogo ideale per godervi un drink o un cocktail.\nAvrete la possibilità di andare in escursione a piedi, a cavallo o in barca. Inoltre vi sarà possibile esplorare i dintorni scegliendo tra numerose escursioni a pagamento.",
